Package: doe
Title: Design and Analysis of Experiments
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Thomas", "Wilson", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible design and analysis of experiments: generated
    randomisation plans, the Lawson chapter examples, and a multi-response
    desirability experiment. This is a workbook repository rather than an
    installed package; DESCRIPTION exists so that renv, CI and
    src/utils/dependencies.R read one dependency manifest instead of three
    copies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
